          "c": "我覺得好緊張。",
          "j": "ngo5 gok3 dak1 hou2 gan2 zoeng1.",
          "e": "I feel very nervous.",
          "note": "覺得 (gok3 dak1) means \"feel / think (that)\" — use it to report how you feel or what you reckon: 我覺得好緊張 (ngo5 gok3 dak1 hou2 gan2 zoeng1) \"I feel very nervous\". Usually followed by 好 (hou2) + an adjective.",
          "bd": [
            {
              "c": "我",
              "j": "ngo5",
              "e": "I"
            },
            {
              "c": "覺得",
              "j": "gok3 dak1",
