            {
              "c": "做得好好",
              "j": "zou6 dak1 hou2 hou2",
              "e": "does very well"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "sid": "feelings-t2-s11",
          "c": "佢好嚴肅，不過對人好大方。",
          "j": "keoi5 hou2 jim4 suk1, bat1 gwo3 deoi3 jan4 hou2 daai6 fong1.",
          "e": "He's very serious, but very generous with people.",
          "note": "嚴肅 (jim4 suk1) \"serious / stern\" describes manner and bearing — not necessarily unfriendly, just formal. Contrast 大方 (daai6 fong1) \"generous / open-handed\", which means free with money and time as well as <b>confident in bearing</b> — the opposite of 怕醜 (paa3 cau2).",
          "bd": [
