          "e": "If you want to make friends, best to be a friendly and thoughtful person.",
          "note": "如果 (jyu4 gwo2) + 最好 (zeoi3 hou2) \"if…best to\" is a gentle advice frame. 細心 (sai3 sam1) \"careful/thorough\" (lit. \"fine heart\") describes someone attentive to detail — 你好細心 (nei5 hou2 sai3 sam1) is a genuine compliment.",
